        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n(3) The Central Government or the State Government, after giving, by notification in the Official Gazette, not less than three months' notice of its intention so to do, may,\nby a like notification, add any description of employment to the "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7a9f1d21504e4d3a866828ddd9205dc1_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "(4) Save as provided by sub-sections (2), (2A) and (3) no compensation shall be payable to an employee in respect of any disease unless the disease is directly attributable to a specific injury by accident arising out of and in the course o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "22cc090f41914c409168ef639d9475c3_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "(5) Nothing herein contained shall be deemed to confer any right to compensation on an employee in respect of any injury if he has instituted in a Civil Court a suit for damages in respect of the injury against the employer or any other per"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "28d2c05a765a4bd0bb0008bed57f1bf7_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The proviso to Section 3(1) contains certain exceptions."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9ea7c87b50c94026bc4066ed6116ad1e_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, third party liability is not one of such exceptions."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7c6e07c978d64da8925ce6b6efa3833c_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Moreover, the concept of contributory negligence cannot be imported to Section 3 of the 1923 Act, since it was not the intention of the Legislature itself to do so."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9f2e9b5a502549d19017bcd1abc4b207_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The only germane considerations are whether the victim was an employee, he died by accident and such accident arose out of and in the course of employment, all of which factors are satisfied in the present case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "705703a5b3f3415e81dabb1569af9727_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
