          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. Insofar as the second ground of challenge is concerned, we are of the opinion that the bare minimum wages need not necessarily be the only relevant factor for grant of compensation."
      },
